  "scope": "The legacy NBSM source saves QPRET in X2, loads the S1-indexed six-word CDU angle vector, stores it into CDUSPOT, loads VAC32D, calls the qualified TRG*NBSM composition and finally performs source STCALL32D/X2. Source angle arrays cover sixteen physical addresses across all erasable-bank contexts, including actual P51 MARKDOWN/MARK2DWN addresses. The saved indirect fixed FCADR must be >=004000 because source GOTO classifies lower words as erasable indirection. The input includes the actual P51 return036052 and P20 return047126. INTBIT15/A are computed for both lower and upper fixed banks. The source interpreter genuine EDOP0 checks in the leading stages are exposed; pending VLOAD and internal CALL/NEWOPS remain under the same canonical owner."
